    "lawCode": "Amd §76, Cor L",
    "lawSection": "Correction Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S1315\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the correction law, in relation to services for\ninmates of state correctional facilities\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill amends section 76 of the correction law, as\nadded by chapter 506 of the laws of 2014.\n\nSection 2 of the bill is the effective date.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nAs indicated in the Governor's approval memo number 22, this bill\nprovides an amendment to chapter 506 of the laws of 2014.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATION:\n\nNone\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nOn the same date and in the same manner as chapter 506 of the laws of\n2014.\n\n",
